{
  "slug": "asset-generator",
  "name": "Asset Generator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate production-ready visual assets without leaving your terminal. Describe what you need in plain English: icons, illustrations, placeholders, and Blueprint Studio generates them in your brand's style and saves them to your project. Manage brands, invite teammates, create custom styles, and automate with API keys. Browser-based auth, no keys to copy.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `asset-generator` (Use when the user wants to generate, browse, download, or manage visual assets (icons, illustrations, images, graphics, placeholders)…), `brand-manager` (Manage Blueprint Studio brands, team members, styles, and API keys)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `asset-generator`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install asset-generator@claude-community` from `Blueprint-Studio-AI/claude-code-asset-generator`.",
